 "\nAl igual como ocurri\[OAcute] con el pozo de potencial, este caso solo \
conduce a que ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"\[Psi]", "(", "x", ")"}], "=", "0"}], TraditionalForm]],
  ExpressionUUID->"b49bc5f0-d97e-4ea2-9d19-fb4adb01f933"],
 ". Es decir, la part\[IAcute]cula no puede existir en un estado cuya energ\
\[IAcute]a est\[EAcute] por debajo del m\[IAcute]nimo absoluto del potencial. \
Debido a aquello, solo estudiaremos los casos (a) y (b). \n\n\n",
 StyleBox["\[DownQuestion]C\[OAcute]mo unificamos los casos (a) y (b)?", 
  "Subsection"],
 "\n\nAmbos tienen un ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["k", "out"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "b5bce9b0-4b77-4abe-a90e-8b2e55071cfa"],
 " real y positivo, de modo que la naturaleza de las funciones ser\[AAcute] \
la misma afuera de la barrera. La \[UAcute]nica diferencia estar\[AAcute] \
dentro del la barrera. \n\t\[FilledSmallCircle] \tSi ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"\[CapitalDelta]\[ScriptCapitalE]", ">", "\[CapitalDelta]V"}], 
   TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->"c12e5fe3-2015-4b81-913f-9987ad0645bc"],
 ", tendremos que ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"\[Eta]", ">", "1"}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "ad11c9c1-d52d-49b7-be5a-0c3055a24ce4"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox["k", "in"], ">", "0"}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "e92f13f1-9e31-4b7f-aea9-417bc6a92d84"],
 " y ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox["k", "in", "2"], ">", "0"}], TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "b5939b39-d11b-4dba-803e-a752ae73443a"],
 ". \n\t\tLa onda se mover\[AAcute] como ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    UnderscriptBox[
     RowBox[{"Onda", " ", "oscilatoria"}], 
     RowBox[{"(", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"Regi\[OAcute]n", " ", "1"}], ",", "  ", "\[Equilibrium]"}], 
      ")"}]], "\[Rule]", 
    RowBox[{
     UnderscriptBox[
      RowBox[{"Onda", " ", "oscilatoria"}], 
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Regi\[OAcute]n", " ", "2"}], ",", "  ", "\[Equilibrium]"}], 
       ")"}]], "\[Rule]", 
     UnderscriptBox[
      RowBox[{"Onda", " ", "oscilatoria"}], 
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Regi\[OAcute]n", " ", "3"}], ",", "  ", "\[Rule]"}], 
       ")"}]]}]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "dd3e488d-9c41-4805-bac4-21af701046bb"],
 ".\n\n\t\[FilledSmallCircle] \tSi ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"\[CapitalDelta]\[ScriptCapitalE]", "<", "\[CapitalDelta]V"}], 
   TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->"2bf04aad-37ee-416a-a40f-e8b5f441d6e6"],
 ", tendremos que ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"0", "<", "\[Eta]", "\[LessEqual]", "1"}], TraditionalForm]],
  ExpressionUUID->"55ac6605-cb31-49b7-8fac-18a348851060"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox["k", "in"], "=", 
    SubscriptBox["\[ImaginaryI]\[Gamma]", "in"]}], TraditionalForm]],
  ExpressionUUID->"d817b778-233d-47bd-b3bd-32212922a1bb"],
 " y ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox["k", "in", "2"], "\[LessEqual]", "0"}], 
   TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "b576145f-a0e3-451d-8a26-bc21263430e9"],
 ". \n\t\tLa onda se mover\[AAcute] como ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    UnderscriptBox[
     RowBox[{"Onda", " ", "oscilatoria"}], 
     RowBox[{"(", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"Regi\[OAcute]n", " ", "1"}], ",", "  ", "\[Equilibrium]"}], 
      ")"}]], "\[Rule]", 
    RowBox[{
     UnderscriptBox[
      RowBox[{"Onda", " ", 
       StyleBox["evanescente",
        FontWeight->"Bold"]}], 
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Regi\[OAcute]n", " ", "2"}], ",", "  ", "\[Equilibrium]"}], 
       ")"}]], "\[Rule]", 
     UnderscriptBox[
      RowBox[{"Onda", " ", "oscilatoria"}], 
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Regi\[OAcute]n", " ", "3"}], ",", "  ", "\[Rule]"}], 
       ")"}]]}]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "26450a04-1cc1-45ff-90b8-f037c97fea51"],
 ".\n\nAmbos casos tendr\[AAcute]n 5 t\[EAcute]rminos, respectivamente \
asociados a ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["A", "1"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "24a86bf5-cd22-4d99-a0f1-356a2d81a03e"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["B", "1"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "c33091d9-0ef8-412f-97a7-8d2aaf4a4fc8"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["A", "2"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "f62fa77e-c56d-4814-8d30-127af2b977a0"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["B", "2"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "a10ccbc7-4a03-4ef7-8de6-9cce782861c2"],
 " y ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["A", "3"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "644d5125-993a-41d5-b9c3-620d082400b4"],
 ". Y ambos casos constituir\[AAcute]n sistemas de 4 ecuaciones para 5 \
coeficientes. Si ocupamos ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["A", "1"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "c66bc6d4-be1a-41b2-a523-bdc6a9bf52f6"],
 " como referencia, estas 4 ecuaciones pasan a ser un ",
 StyleBox["sistema inhomog\[EAcute]neo",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " para ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["B", "1"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "d92ead21-381f-40fe-9189-eed28278eff2"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["A", "2"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "e10486bf-47c6-47af-a59f-06486a615b9f"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["B", "2"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "ae3a05c9-5806-4cf9-8749-48e5299b4413"],
 " y ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["A", "3"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "b822cda5-7875-4cba-bbdb-2f0ccd46b845"],
 ". No ser\[AAcute] necesario imponer condiciones adicionales de dependencia \
lineal y, en consecuencia, ",
 StyleBox["no aparece discretizaci\[OAcute]n en la energ\[IAcute]a",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 ". ",
 "\n\nEn t\[EAcute]rminos de c\[AAcute]lculo, se tratar\[AAcute] de permitir \
valores imaginarios para ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["k", "in"], TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "1e009829-d45e-44fb-86c8-2aa7845d5f62"],
 ". El recordar que ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"cos", "(", 
     RowBox[{"\[ImaginaryI]", "\[VeryThinSpace]", "x"}], ")"}], "=", 
    RowBox[{"cosh", "(", "x", ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "b0da773b-c7b0-40c4-9797-2f7c0115c840"],
 " y ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"sin", "(", 
     RowBox[{"\[ImaginaryI]", "\[VeryThinSpace]", "x"}], ")"}], "=", 
    RowBox[{"\[ImaginaryI]", "\[VeryThinSpace]", 
     RowBox[{"sinh", "(", "x", ")"}]}]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "c3fcf75f-69e3-4515-a326-684b27990fad"],
 " ayudar\[AAcute] a unificar las expresiones, que ahora se tratar\[AAcute]n \
\[UAcute]nicamente en t\[EAcute]rminos de ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"0", "<", "\[Eta]", "<", "\[Infinity]"}], TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "9b9c0aab-9b94-472b-b802-ddbdbbb52f5c"],
 ", en lugar de separarlo en dos casos. \n\n\n",
 StyleBox["Sistema de ecuaciones y coeficientes de reflexi\[OAcute]n y \
transmisi\[OAcute]n.", "Subsection"],
 "\n\nSi representamos matricialmente el sistema de ecuaciones debido a las \
condiciones de continuidad, tendremos\n\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"\t", 
    FormBox[
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"(", "\[NoBreak]", GridBox[{
          {
           SuperscriptBox["\[ExponentialE]", 
            RowBox[{
             FractionBox["1", "2"], " ", "\[ImaginaryI]", " ", "L", " ", 
             SubscriptBox["k", "out"]}]], 
           RowBox[{"-", 
            SuperscriptBox["\[ExponentialE]", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"-", 
               FractionBox["1", "2"]}], " ", "\[ImaginaryI]", " ", "L", " ", 
              SubscriptBox["k", "in"]}]]}], 
           RowBox[{"-", 
            SuperscriptBox["\[ExponentialE]", 
             RowBox[{
              FractionBox["1", "2"], " ", "\[ImaginaryI]", " ", "L", " ", 
              SubscriptBox["k", "in"]}]]}], "0"},
          {
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"-", "\[ImaginaryI]"}], " ", 
            SubscriptBox["k", "out"], " ", 
            SuperscriptBox["\[ExponentialE]", 
             RowBox[{
              FractionBox["1", "2"], " ", "\[ImaginaryI]", " ", "L", " ", 
              SubscriptBox["k", "out"]}]]}], 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"-", "\[ImaginaryI]"}], " ", 
            SubscriptBox["k", "in"], " ", 
            SuperscriptBox["\[ExponentialE]", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"-", 
               FractionBox["1", "2"]}], " ", "\[ImaginaryI]", " ", "L", " ", 
              SubscriptBox["k", "in"]}]]}], 
           RowBox[{"\[ImaginaryI]", " ", 
            SubscriptBox["k", "in"], " ", 
            SuperscriptBox["\[ExponentialE]", 
             RowBox[{
              FractionBox["1", "2"], " ", "\[ImaginaryI]", " ", "L", " ", 
              SubscriptBox["k", "in"]}]]}], "0"},
          {"0", 
           SuperscriptBox["\[ExponentialE]", 
            RowBox[{
             FractionBox["1", "2"], " ", "\[ImaginaryI]", " ", "L", " ", 
             SubscriptBox["k", "in"]}]], 
           SuperscriptBox["\[ExponentialE]", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"-", 
              FractionBox["1", "2"]}], " ", "\[ImaginaryI]", " ", "L", " ", 
             SubscriptBox["k", "in"]}]], 
           RowBox[{"-", 
            SuperscriptBox["\[ExponentialE]", 
             RowBox[{
              FractionBox["1", "2"], " ", "\[ImaginaryI]", " ", "L", " ", 
              SubscriptBox["k", "out"]}]]}]},
          {"0", 
           RowBox[{"\[ImaginaryI]", " ", 
            SubscriptBox["k", "in"], " ", 
            SuperscriptBox["\[ExponentialE]", 
             RowBox[{
              FractionBox["1", "2"], " ", "\[ImaginaryI]", " ", "L", " ", 
              SubscriptBox["k", "in"]}]]}], 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"-", "\[ImaginaryI]"}], " ", 
            SubscriptBox["k", "in"], " ", 
            SuperscriptBox["\[ExponentialE]", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"-", 
               FractionBox["1", "2"]}], " ", "\[ImaginaryI]", " ", "L", " ", 
              SubscriptBox["k", "in"]}]]}], 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"-", "\[ImaginaryI]"}], " ", 
            SubscriptBox["k", "out"], " ", 
            SuperscriptBox["\[ExponentialE]", 
             RowBox[{
              FractionBox["1", "2"], " ", "\[ImaginaryI]", " ", "L", " ", 
              SubscriptBox["k", "out"]}]]}]}
         },
         GridBoxAlignment->{"Columns" -> {{Center}}, "Rows" -> {{Baseline}}},
         GridBoxSpacings->{"Columns" -> {
             Offset[0.27999999999999997`], {
              Offset[0.7]}, 
             Offset[0.27999999999999997`]}, "Rows" -> {
             Offset[0.2], {
              Offset[0.4]}, 
             Offset[0.2]}}], "\[NoBreak]", ")"}], "\[CenterDot]", 
       RowBox[{"(", "\[NoBreak]", GridBox[{
          {
           SubscriptBox["B", "1"]},
          {
           SubscriptBox["A", "2"]},
          {
           SubscriptBox["B", "2"]},
          {
           SubscriptBox["A", "3"]}
         },
         GridBoxAlignment->{"Columns" -> {{Center}}, "Rows" -> {{Baseline}}},
         GridBoxSpacings->{"Columns" -> {
             Offset[0.27999999999999997`], {
              Offset[0.7]}, 
             Offset[0.27999999999999997`]}, "Rows" -> {
             Offset[0.2], {
              Offset[0.4]}, 
             Offset[0.2]}}], "\[NoBreak]", ")"}]}], "\[LongEqual]", 
      RowBox[{"-", 
       RowBox[{
        SubscriptBox["A", "1"], "(", "\[NoBreak]", GridBox[{
          {
           SuperscriptBox["\[ExponentialE]", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"-", 
              FractionBox["1", "2"]}], " ", "\[ImaginaryI]", " ", "L", " ", 
             SubscriptBox["k", "out"]}]]},
          {
           RowBox[{"\[ImaginaryI]", " ", 
            SubscriptBox["k", "out"], " ", 
            SuperscriptBox["\[ExponentialE]", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"-", 
               FractionBox["1", "2"]}], " ", "\[ImaginaryI]", " ", "L", " ", 
              SubscriptBox["k", "out"]}]]}]},
          {"0"},
          {"0"}
         },
         GridBoxAlignment->{"Columns" -> {{Center}}, "Rows" -> {{Baseline}}},
         GridBoxSpacings->{"Columns" -> {
             Offset[0.27999999999999997`], {
              Offset[0.7]}, 
             Offset[0.27999999999999997`]}, "Rows" -> {
             Offset[0.2], {
              Offset[0.4]}, 
             Offset[0.2]}}], "\[NoBreak]", ")"}]}]}],
     TraditionalForm], " "}], TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "0e3f4e57-aaa0-4623-97ff-5f427b6f4b5d"],
 "\n\n\nAl igual que con el caso (a) del pozo de potencial, podemos definir \
",
 StyleBox["amplitudes de reflexi\[OAcute]n (\[ScriptR]) y transmisi\[OAcute]n \
(",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["\[ScriptT]", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "6505fc90-1bb9-4f75-bc93-08b155ccd399"],
 StyleBox[")",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", que contienen informaci\[OAcute]n de con cu\[AAcute]nta probabilidad \
ocurrir\[AAcute] cada opci\[OAcute]n y si la onda gana alguna fase en ellas. \
\n\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"\t", 
    RowBox[{"\[ScriptR]", "=", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       FractionBox[
        SubscriptBox["B", "1"], 
        SubscriptBox["A", "1"]], " \t", 
       StyleBox["y",
        FontSlant->"Plain"], " \t", "\[ScriptT]"}], "=", 
      RowBox[{
       FractionBox[
        SubscriptBox["A", "3"], 
        SubscriptBox["A", "1"]], "."}]}]}]}], TraditionalForm]],
  ExpressionUUID->"f6ae2df4-b1cb-4d38-991f-8de293f0a4f3"],
 "\n\nNuevamente, las probabilidades de que la part\[IAcute]cula termine \
siendo reflejada o transmitida se calculan como solemos hacerlo en Mec\
\[AAcute]nica Cu\[AAcute]ntica: m\[OAcute]dulo al cuadrado de las amplitudes.\
\n\n\t",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[GridBox[{
     {Cell["R",ExpressionUUID->"f4a0f536-4b8c-42ee-9dfa-5af47e2932ec"], "=", 
      SuperscriptBox["\[VerticalLine]\[ScriptR]\[VerticalLine]", "2"], "=", 
      FractionBox[
       RowBox[{"2", " ", 
        SuperscriptBox[
         RowBox[{"(", 
          RowBox[{
           SubsuperscriptBox["k", "in", "2"], "-", 
           SubsuperscriptBox["k", "out", "2"]}], ")"}], "2"], " ", 
        RowBox[{
         SuperscriptBox["sin", "2"], "(", 
         RowBox[{"L", " ", 
          SubscriptBox["k", "in"]}], ")"}]}], 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"6", " ", 
         SubsuperscriptBox["k", "in", "2"], " ", 
         SubsuperscriptBox["k", "out", "2"]}], "+", 
        SubsuperscriptBox["k", "in", "4"], "+", 
        SubsuperscriptBox["k", "out", "4"], " ", "-", " ", 
        RowBox[{
         SuperscriptBox[
          RowBox[{"(", 
           RowBox[{
            SubsuperscriptBox["k", "in", "2"], "-", 
            SubsuperscriptBox["k", "out", "2"]}], ")"}], "2"], " ", 
         RowBox[{"cos", "(", 
          RowBox[{"2", " ", "L", " ", 
           SubscriptBox["k", "in"]}], ")"}]}]}]]}
    }], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "35c55197-8188-473c-aaad-a80faeeccdfc"],
 " \t y \t",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[GridBox[{
     {"T", "=", 
      SuperscriptBox["\[VerticalLine]\[ScriptT]\[VerticalLine]", "2"], 
      FractionBox[
       RowBox[{"8", " ", 
        SubsuperscriptBox["k", "in", "2"], " ", 
        SubsuperscriptBox["k", "out", "2"]}], 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"6", " ", 
         SubsuperscriptBox["k", "in", "2"], " ", 
         SubsuperscriptBox["k", "out", "2"]}], "+", 
        SubsuperscriptBox["k", "in", "4"], "+", 
        SubsuperscriptBox["k", "out", "4"], " ", "-", " ", 
        RowBox[{
         SuperscriptBox[
          RowBox[{"(", 
           RowBox[{
            SubsuperscriptBox["k", "in", "2"], "-", 
            SubsuperscriptBox["k", "out", "2"]}], ")"}], "2"], " ", 
         RowBox[{"cos", "(", 
          RowBox[{"2", " ", "L", " ", 
           SubscriptBox["k", "in"]}], ")"}]}]}]]}
    }], TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "aeb4a017-847c-4e36-b759-0f6408986858"],
 "  \n\nLa parte ",
 StyleBox["potencialmente oscilatoria",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " de estas probabilidades est\[AAcute]n en las funciones \
trigonom\[EAcute]tricas ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"cos", "(", 
    RowBox[{"2", " ", "L", " ", 
     SubscriptBox["k", "in"]}], ")"}], TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "558ea0d8-40f4-4824-b97e-3913f6d7aefb"],
 " y ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SuperscriptBox["sin", "2"], "(", 
    RowBox[{"L", " ", 
     SubscriptBox["k", "in"]}], ")"}], TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "b9ead2eb-4f5a-4d52-8a1b-3734463fd08a"],
 ". \n\t\[EmptySmallCircle] Si la energ\[IAcute]a de la part\[IAcute]cula es \
mayor que la altura m\[AAcute]xima de la barrera (",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"\[Eta]", ">", "1"}], TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "bcd09b72-251c-4832-ba19-c3c3eaee09bd"],
 "), ocurrir\[AAcute] que ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["R", TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "3384ecd0-3c3a-466c-8e02-d4fa936cb42f"],
 " y ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["T", TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "be4958b9-412e-461c-9092-36dbf3e793ea"],
 " exhibir\[AAcute]n m\[AAcute]ximos y m\[IAcute]nimos para diversos valores \
de ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["L", TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "b22184c2-990f-4b68-9f5c-d5a54073d0df"],
 ". Aparecer\[AAcute]n resonancias (m\[AAcute]ximos en la transmisi\[OAcute]n \
o en la reflexi\[OAcute]n) y \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]anti-resonancias\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote].\n\t\[EmptySmallCircle] Si la energ\[IAcute]a de la \
part\[IAcute]cula no supera el m\[AAcute]ximo de la barrera (",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"0", "<", "\[Eta]", "\[LessEqual]", "1"}], TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "96217206-806f-4264-aedd-e5a9cd3cf4d4"],
 "), estas funciones oscilatorias se transforman en funciones \
hiperb\[OAcute]licas. \n\n",
 StyleBox["* Para ver los gr\[AAcute]ficos interactivos, ejecute la siguiente \
celda y vaya al final del archivo. ",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "\n"
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{4.0010752499033947`*^9, 4.001075995002026*^9}, {
   4.001076620542633*^9, 4.001076630888975*^9}, {4.001077526105179*^9, 
   4.001077534822049*^9}, {4.001078448411798*^9, 4.0010784484128*^9}, {
   4.001080079054737*^9, 4.0010800814657793`*^9}, {4.0010801668666363`*^9, 
   4.0010801770584593`*^9}, 4.001783765505896*^9, {4.001787116966515*^9, 
   4.001787175847925*^9}, {4.001787213468502*^9, 4.001787499465765*^9}, {
   4.001787548073016*^9, 4.00178755625659*^9}, {4.001787593018446*^9, 
   4.001787621776705*^9}, {4.0017877264358397`*^9, 4.0017877826034107`*^9}, {
   4.001788204867573*^9, 4.0017882303662663`*^9}, {4.001788320463874*^9, 
   4.001788320464159*^9}, {4.0022957135274*^9, 4.002295713527698*^9}, {
   4.002629289826337*^9, 4.002629383015732*^9}, {4.002629436171464*^9, 
   4.00262985596942*^9}, {4.002629946584711*^9, 4.00262995101686*^9}, {
   4.002630187081851*^9, 4.002630413141852*^9}, {4.002630474705818*^9, 
   4.002630710091569*^9}, {4.002630813072845*^9, 4.00263098072679*^9}, {
   4.00263118975353*^9, 4.002631191217155*^9}, {4.002631255368297*^9, 
